==Strategy==
Bring [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] for the Bore and a rusher such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] for Rathalos. Butterfly Cat is also useful for the Owlbrows, making it the best choice here.

